            <pubDate>Fri, 27 Mar 2026 18:09:36 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/wangwanjie/HostsEditor/releases/tag/v1.7.2</link>
            <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.7.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/wangwanjie/HostsEditor/releases/download/v1.7.2/HostsEditor_V_1.7.2.dmg" length="5626003" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="RNaiL8DPvvUFhHaDTqi1UCEY1zhsxEeFGstJNDHpoKBcSDcDOE6UH17z+tZqExUupP+iAtwT2Mk+YNLXVV3fDQ==" />
            <description>&lt;h1&gt;更新内容&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;调整 hosts 文本高亮规则，被整行注释掉的条目现在会统一显示为注释颜色，避免与正常规则高亮混淆。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
        </item>
        <item>
